{"parentUuid":"69a20de3-2b57-4657-914f-d1087895c833","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a38ef37448d2d0a8d","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01TKR7XPvdWzU92R6DzRTyDH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Q8gURdy5ZrciSL3wucdcHZ","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://github.com/lip6/painless","prompt":"What solvers are wrapped by Painless? How do you wrap a new solver? What is the Sharer interface? What licenses? What real-world performance gains over portfolio without sharing?"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5630,"cache_read_input_tokens":20998,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5630,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":67,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CaoovjDn5BxNAq93APXrk","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"a56a2be3-b321-4b00-b062-fec039888251","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:05:54.853Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"cba34eaa-ce31-4c88-a829-e85c01215ed9","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"56e72661-9c70-4718-ac89-40d9fd2179ff","agentId":"a38ef37448d2d0a8d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PSYugVDaWJobT63p3LeH4M","type":"tool_result","content":"# Clause Sharing and Worker Parameters\n\n## Direct Clause Sharing Parameters\n\n**share_binary_clauses** (line 203)\n- Default: `true`\n- Comment: \"Allows sharing of new learned binary clause between workers.\"\n\n**share_glue_clauses** (line 285)\n- Default: `true`\n- Comment: \"Allows sharing of short glue clauses between workers. Implicitly disabled if share_binary_clauses is false.\"\n\n**share_glue_clauses_dtime** (line 322)\n- Default: `1.0`\n- Comment: \"The amount of dtime between each export of shared glue clauses.\"\n\n**minimize_shared_clauses** (line 300)\n- Default: `true`\n- Comment: \"Minimize and detect subsumption of shared clauses immediately after they are imported.\"\n\n## Worker Configuration Parameters\n\n**num_workers** (line 206)\n- Default: `0`\n- Comment: Specifies parallel worker threads; zero means use all available cores.\n\n**num_search_workers** (line 100)\n- Default: `0`\n- Comment: Deprecated alternative to `num_workers`.\n\n## Shared Bounds Parameters\n\n**share_objective_bounds** (line 113)\n- Default: `true`\n- Comment: \"Allows objective sharing between workers.\"\n\n**share_level_zero_bounds** (line 114)\n- Default: `true`\n- Comment: \"Allows sharing of the bounds of modified variables at level 0.\"\n\n**share_linear2_bounds** (line 326)\n- Default: `false`\n- Comment: Shares precedence-related bounds; marked non-deterministic."}]},"uuid":"ca8bf0f5-4a31-40e8-b9c9-863d3b508279","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:05:56.791Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"cba34eaa-ce31-4c88-a829-e85c01215ed9","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
