{"parentUuid":"328aabb9-65b8-4c7b-bae7-c8e9e8080422","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6b52db07-c10e-437b-a08d-e086ce9c32e9","agentId":"a38ef37448d2d0a8d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012RU8nRkNBu8r5UrKXT6X1w","type":"tool_result","content":"Based on the content provided, Laurent Perron is listed as the assignee for this GitHub issue (#2399), but **no comments or explanations from him are included in the webpage content shown**. \n\nThe page displays only the issue description submitted by the user, which reports that CP-SAT on a 32-thread AWS machine uses only \"between half and two thirds of all threads\" despite setting `num_search_workers = multiprocessing.cpu_count()`.\n\nTo find Perron's actual response addressing thread usage, clause sharing, or worker behavior, you would need to view the comments section of the full GitHub issue, which is not included in this excerpt."}]},"uuid":"2117309e-b4f5-4916-a572-0c3f5e79adde","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:07:02.171Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"328aabb9-65b8-4c7b-bae7-c8e9e8080422","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"d7336fd8-b4ea-4e82-899e-cf7f9f719058","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6b52db07-c10e-437b-a08d-e086ce9c32e9","agentId":"a38ef37448d2d0a8d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XZP8DDYv3d4tCjkzFEMwNi","type":"tool_result","content":"# Classes Defined in synchronization.h\n\nBased on the header file content, here are the main classes:\n\n1. **SolverStatusChangeInfo** - struct for solver status updates\n2. **SharedSolutionRepository** - template class managing best solutions\n3. **SharedLPSolutionRepository** - LP solution repository\n4. **SharedSolutionPool** - manages feasible solutions in buckets\n5. **SharedLsSolutionRepository** - stores solutions from feasibility jump workers\n6. **SharedIncompleteSolutionManager** - manages partially filled solutions\n7. **SharedResponseManager** - manages global best response and bounds\n8. **SharedBoundsManager** - manages variable bounds across workers\n9. **UniqueClauseStream** - emits clause batches without duplicates\n10. **SharedClausesManager** - holds clauses found by workers\n11. **SharedLinear2Bounds** - exchanges root level bounds on linear expressions\n\n## SharedClausesManager Public Methods\n\nThe public interface includes:\n\n- `AddBinaryClause(int id, int lit1, int lit2)` - adds binary clauses\n- `GetUnseenClauses(int id)` - returns new glue clauses\n- `AddBatch(int id, CompactVectorVector<int> batch)` - adds clause batches\n- `GetUnseenBinaryClauses(int id, std::vector<std::pair<int, int>>*)` - retrieves binary clauses\n- `RegisterNewId(absl::string_view worker_name, bool may_terminate_early)` - registers workers\n- `Synchronize()` - unlocks waiting clauses and starts sharing rounds\n- `NotifyNumImported(int id, int64_t num_imported)` - tracks imports\n- `LogStatistics(SolverLogger* logger)` - outputs search statistics"}]},"uuid":"cdb4f923-9c59-46b6-9a06-cf5ae8073bf7","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:07:04.713Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d7336fd8-b4ea-4e82-899e-cf7f9f719058","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
