{"parentUuid":"7b0d874f-53f4-4a10-b007-a02c2ce452d4","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6b52db07-c10e-437b-a08d-e086ce9c32e9","agentId":"a38ef37448d2d0a8d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GbvwU53ej4Z1EokPiBbHhx","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"UniqueClauseStream\" OR \"SharedClausesManager\" or-tools shared memory mutex thread\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"std::shared_mutex in C++ - GeeksforGeeks\",\"url\":\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/cpp/std-shared_mutex-in-cpp/\"},{\"title\":\"Shared Mutex (Read/write lock) — CLUE++ 0.2.6 documentation\",\"url\":\"https://cppstdx.readthedocs.io/en/latest/shared_mutex.html\"},{\"title\":\"Mutexes and Locks in C++. Multithreading offers immense power to… | by Amresh Kumar | Medium\",\"url\":\"https://medium.com/@kamresh485/mutexes-and-locks-in-c-5f332918156e\"},{\"title\":\"Shared-State Concurrency - The Rust Programming Language\",\"url\":\"https://doc.rust-lang.org/book/ch16-03-shared-state.html\"},{\"title\":\"Shared State - The Rust Programming Language\",\"url\":\"https://web.mit.edu/rust-lang_v1.25/arch/amd64_ubuntu1404/share/doc/rust/html/book/second-edition/ch16-03-shared-state.html\"},{\"title\":\"Guide to the POSIX Threads Library\",\"url\":\"http://h30266.www3.hpe.com/odl/vax/opsys/vmsos73/vmsos73/6493/6101pro_006.html\"},{\"title\":\"C++ Tutorial: C++11/C++14 7. Threads with Shared Memory and Mutex - 2017\",\"url\":\"https://www.bogotobogo.com/cplusplus/C11/7_C11_Thread_Sharing_Memory.php\"},{\"title\":\"std::shared_mutex - cppreference.com\",\"url\":\"https://en.cppreference.com/cpp/thread/shared_mutex\"},{\"title\":\"Mutex Objects - Win32 apps | Microsoft Learn\",\"url\":\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/sync/mutex-objects\"},{\"title\":\"Shared State - Shared State - The Rust Programming Language\",\"url\":\"https://phaiax.github.io/mdBook/rustbook/ch16-03-shared-state.html\"}]\n\nThe search results don't contain specific informatio