{"parentUuid":"48002749-911f-4961-b13f-c865a697873e","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"1732d7ae-d708-45cf-8953-6a921ea7df54","agentId":"a38ef37448d2d0a8d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PhEsEvFcvooRNngAzPQ6zL","type":"tool_result","content":"# SolverInterface Methods Analysis\n\nBased on the provided file content, the SolverInterface does **not** include methods for `importClauses`, `exportClauses`, or `addLearnedClause`.\n\nThe interface defines these clause-related methods:\n\n**Adding clauses:**\n- `\"virtual void addClause(ClauseExchangePtr clause) = 0;\"`\n- `\"virtual void addClauses(const std::vector<ClauseExchangePtr>& clauses) = 0;\"`\n- `\"virtual void addInitialClauses(const std::vector<simpleClause>& clauses, unsigned int nbVars) = 0;\"`\n- `\"virtual void addInitialClauses(const lit_t* literals, unsigned int clsCount, unsigned int nbVars) = 0;\"`\n\nThe interface focuses on permanent and initial clause insertion rather than clause import/export or learned clause management. No method signatures matching the ones you mentioned appear in this header file."}]},"uuid":"6b50fc9e-4871-4653-a7d7-e31ec813d8c5","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:07:39.132Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"48002749-911f-4961-b13f-c865a697873e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"0a548f96-0a8e-4150-9a27-ac9332666ad5","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"1732d7ae-d708-45cf-8953-6a921ea7df54","agentId":"a38ef37448d2d0a8d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AidBjQAPJgWuWztUam3HBT","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"D-Painless\" distributed MPI portfolio SAT 2024 PaInlesS extension\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"D-Painless: A Framework for Distributed Portfolio SAT Solving | Springer Nature Link\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-90653-4_3\"},{\"title\":\"(PDF) D-Painless: A Framework for Distributed Portfolio SAT Solving\",\"url\":\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/391418351_D-Painless_A_Framework_for_Distributed_Portfolio_SAT_Solving\"},{\"title\":\"D-Painless: A Framework for Distributed Portfolio SAT Solving - Archive ouverte HAL\",\"url\":\"https://hal.science/hal-05084417\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - lip6/painless: A framework to ease parallelization of sequential SAT solvers\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/lip6/painless\"},{\"title\":\"MallobSat: Scalable SAT Solving by Clause Sharing\",\"url\":\"https://dominikschreiber.de/papers/2024-jair-mallobsat.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"PaInleSS: a Framework for Parallel SAT Solving - Archive ouverte HAL\",\"url\":\"https://hal.science/hal-01540785v1\"},{\"title\":\"Distributed SAT Solving | Wonderings of a SAT geek\",\"url\":\"https://www.msoos.org/tag/distributed-sat-solving/\"},{\"title\":\"Distributed Cube and Conquer with Paracooba\",\"url\":\"https://fmv.jku.at/papers/HeisingerFleuryBiere-SAT20.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - Nauchnik/pdsat: Parallel and Distributed SAT solver\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/Nauchnik/pdsat\"},{\"title\":\"Solving Sat in a Distributed Cloud: : A Portfolio Approach\",\"url\":\"https://dl.acm.org/doi/abs/10.2478/amcs-2019-0019\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found comprehensive information about D-Painless and its connection to the PaInleSS framework:\n\n## D-Painless: A Framework for Distributed Portfolio SAT Solving\n\nD-Painless is a new extension of the Painless framework to include the distributed portfolio strategy and clause sharing.\n\n### Overview\nD-Painless extends the framework to include distributed portfolio strategy and clause sharing, aiming to broaden Painless's functionality for more effective and comprehensive distributed SAT solving methodologies.\n\n### Technical Implementation\nA big part of the deployment of the distributed environment is managed by MPI, which mainly requires a hostfile identifying the different machines to be used.\n\nThe node with mpiRank = 0 acts as the master node and is notified by other nodes when they find a solution, checks if it has found a solution and if a worker node sent a termination notification, and once the master knows whether a solution was found or not, it sends a message to all other nodes indicating whether they should continue or stop.\n\n### Evaluation\nThe versions were tested as submitted to the 2024 SAT Competition. The evaluation used Intel Xeon E5-2630 v3 processors with 8 physical cores each and 128 GB of RAM, across 25 machines totaling 400 cores.\n\n### Publication\nD-Painless: A Framework for Distributed Portfolio SAT Solving was presented at the Tools and Algorithms for the Construction and Analysis of Systems conference in May 2025 in Hamilton, Canada.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"4dc47036-b8e0-445d-9b7c-500005f0cae9","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:07:43.314Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0a548f96-0a8e-4150-9a27-ac9332666ad5","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"4dc47036-b8e0-445d-9b7c-500005f0cae9","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a38ef37448d2d0a8d","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_014wBbvdkc1xf8MmfrLsFhpU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have enough material now. Let me synthesize the findings.\n\n---\n\n## 调研报告：跨进程 CP-SAT clause sharing 可行性\n\n### 1. Painless 框架\n\n[lip6/painless](https://github.com/lip6/painless) 是 Sorbonne/LIP6 的\"通用并行 SAT 框架\"，把 sequential CDCL solver 套上 worker-sharer 架构。已包装：Kissat（v4.0.2）、CaDiCaL、MapleCOMSPS、Glucose、MiniSat、Lingeling、YalSAT。Sharer 是单独的线程，跑用户选的 SharingStrategy（按 LBD 过滤、buffer 一段时间后广播）。**关键发现：被包装的 solver 必须实现 `SolverInterface.hpp` 里的 `addClause(ClauseExchangePtr)` 等方法**——也就是说，必须在 solver 内部能从外面塞进 learned clause、并且能从 solver 内部 callback 出 learned clause。CP-SAT 这两个 API 都没暴露，所以**Painless 套 CP-SAT 在不改 OR-Tools 源码的前提下做不到**。\n\n### 2. Portfolio without sharing\n\n跨进程跑同一候选、不同 random seed/搜索策略，谁先解出来谁赢——这是最朴素的 portfolio。OR-Tools 已经把这个内置了（见下点），所以你**手动起多进程跑同一候选只在没有共享时才有价值**，且加速天花板就是 portfolio 加速曲线（典型 4 worker → 1.5-2x，且边际递减很快）。\n\n### 3. OR-Tools CP-SAT 内部 8 worker 架构（重点）\n\n**确认在共享，且是真共享。** 关键源码 [`ortools/sat/synchronization.h`](https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/stable/ortools/sat/synchronization.h) 定义了一组 `Shared*Manager` 类：\n\n- `SharedClausesManager` —— 持有 worker 找到的 learned clauses，方法包括 `AddBinaryClause(id, l1, l2)`、`AddBatch(id, batch)`、`GetUnseenClauses(id)`、`GetUnseenBinaryClauses(id, *out)`、`Synchronize()`、`RegisterNewId(worker_name, may_terminate_early)`\n- `UniqueClauseStream` —— 给 worker batch 化导出 clause，去重\n- `SharedBoundsManager` —— 共享变量 root level bounds\n- `SharedResponseManager` —— 共享 best objective、solutions\n- `SharedTreeManager` —— shared tree workers 的子树/nogood 协调\n\n控制开关在 [`sat_parameters.proto`](https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/stable/ortools/sat/sat_parameters.proto)：`share_binary_clauses=true`、`share_glue_clauses=true`、`share_glue_clauses_dtime=1.0`、`minimize_shared_clauses=true`、`share_objective_bounds=true`、`share_level_zero_bounds=true`。**默认全开**。\n\n**架构本质：进程内多线程**——所有 `Shared*Manager` 都是 in-process 的 C++ 对象（mutex 保护），workers 是同一进程内的线程。也就是说你跑 `num_workers=8` 已经在拿 clause sharing 的好处了，**多进程跑同一候选不会自动复制这种共享**——每个进程都有独立的 SharedClausesManager。\n\n最近还有 [Parallelising Lazy Clause Generation with Trail Sharing](https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-95973-8_13) 给 CP-SAT 加了 trail sharing + job reassignment，进一步压榨 worker 间共享，仍然是 in-process。\n\n### 4. 跨进程 clause sharing 工程实现\n\nSAT 圈标准做法是：\n\n- **共享内存**：mmap'd ring buffer，worker 写、其他 worker 轮询读（HordeSat 早期方案）\n- **MPI**：MallobSat / D-Painless 的标配，cluster 间通信\n- **文件系统轮询**：太慢，业内基本不用\n\n但所有这些方案的前提是**solver 能 export learned clause**。CP-SAT 内部明明有 `UniqueClauseStream`，但**它没有 public/SWIG 暴露 export hook**——Python/C++ 用户拿不到。\n\n### 5. Mallob / MallobSat\n\n[domschrei/mallob](https://github.com/domschrei/mallob) 是 [MallobSat](https://dominikschreiber.de/papers/2024-jair-mallobsat.pdf)（JAIR 2024）的实现，3072 cores 上跑过、SAT Competition Cloud Track 五连冠。后端只支持 CDCL SAT solver（Kissat/CaDiCaL/Lingeling/YalSAT/Glucose），**不支持 CP-SAT 或任何 CP solver**。clause sharing 用 MPI 树状聚合 + LBD/length filtering + Bloom filter 去重。[D-Painless](https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-90653-4_3)（TACAS 2025）用 MPI 把 Painless 扩展到分布式，2024 SAT Competition 在 25 机 400 核上测过。\n\n### 6. OR-Tools patch 工程量评估\n\n源码层看，加 export hook 的最小补丁：在 `synchronization.h` 给 `SharedClausesManager` 加个 callback 注册接口，在 `AddBatch`/`AddBinaryClause` 里 fan-out；再通过 [`swig_helper.h`](https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/stable/ortools/sat/swig_helper.h) 暴露给 Python。代码改动 < 200 行。**但**：(a) OR-Tools 团队对这种\"打开内部抽象\"的 PR 历来非常保守（Laurent Perron 在 issue tracker 反复表达过 CP-SAT 内部状态不稳定、不愿暴露低层 API）；(b) 维护一个 fork 长期同步上游成本高，OR-Tools 每月一版；(c) clause 编号、变量编号是 presolve 后的内部表示，跨进程导出必须连同 presolve mapping 一起序列化才有意义。\n\n---\n\n## 给项目的结论\n\n**OR-Tools 的 8 worker 已经在共享 learned clauses（in-process via `SharedClausesManager`）**——这就是你单进程多 worker 的天花板。**多进程跑同一候选不会自动获得 clause 共享**：每个进程独立的 `SharedClausesManager`，跨进程是孤岛。\n\n要打通跨进程：\n- **轻量方案（不可行）**：纯用户代码做不到，CP-SAT 没 export hook\n- **中等方案（patch fork）**：~200 行 C++ patch + SWIG 改 + Python 端共享内存胶水 + 长期 fork 维护，工程量约 3-5 人周首发 + 每月 0.5 人周维护\n- **重型方案（换求解器）**：D 方案，迁到 Painless/Mallob，但要把 CP 模型转成纯 SAT，对你的 IndustrialPlanner 几乎不现实\n\n**实务建议**：4 分钟预算耗尽且 learned clauses 全丢这个痛点，**优先把单进程 worker 数从 8 加到 16/24 + 调大 `share_glue_clauses_dtime` 反向（缩短共享间隔）**，把 in-process sharing 吃满；再把 portfolio 多进程当**多候选并发**（不同候选给不同进程）而不是**同候选共享**用。跨进程 clause sharing 在 ROI 上不划算。\n\n### Sources\n- [lip6/painless GitHub](https://github.com/lip6/painless)\n- [PaInleSS: A Framework for Parallel SAT Solving (HAL paper)](https://hal.science/hal-01540785v1/document)\n- [D-Painless: Distributed Portfolio SAT Solving (Springer)](https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-90653-4_3)\n- [MallobSat: Scalable SAT Solving by Clause Sharing (JAIR 2024)](https://dominikschreiber.de/papers/2024-jair-mallobsat.pdf)\n- [domschrei/mallob GitHub](https://github.com/domschrei/mallob)\n- [or-tools/ortools/sat/synchronization.h](https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/stable/ortools/sat/synchronization.h)\n- [or-tools/ortools/sat/sat_parameters.proto](https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/stable/ortools/sat/sat_parameters.proto)\n- [or-tools/ortools/sat/cp_model_solver.cc](https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/stable/ortools/sat/cp_model_solver.cc)\n- [Parallelising Lazy Clause Generation with Trail Sharing](https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-95973-8_13)\n- [CP-SAT Primer: Under the Hood](https://d-krupke.github.io/cpsat-primer/07_under_the_hood.html)\n- [Parallel Clause Sharing Strategy Based on Graph Structure (SAT 2024)](https://drops.dagstuhl.de/storage/00lipics/lipics-vol305-sat2024/LIPIcs.SAT.2024.17/LIPIcs.SAT.2024.17.pdf)"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2274,"cache_read_input_tokens":44958,"output_tokens":3367,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2274},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":3367,"cache_read_input_tokens":44958,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2274,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2274,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Caop5M6m5t2pibu8C62jn","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"96932325-47d4-4b21-9f78-1cb2cc879251","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:08:46.516Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
